#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# 默认全部按文本处理并统一成 LF，避免 Windows 贡献者提交 .java / .json 时带 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jar binary
*.ogg binary

# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# Workflow 里的 run 脚本由 bash 执行，混进 CR 会变成 "set: invalid option"
*.yml           text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf
